WEBVTT

00:00.990 --> 00:02.860
<b>Was that the end?</b>

00:02.960 --> 00:04.360
<b>It's hard to know.</b>

00:04.460 --> 00:07.760
<b>The character's impact is too strong.</b>

00:08.030 --> 00:09.690
<b>We don't know what to say.</b>

00:09.800 --> 00:15.830
<b>He became a semi-regular
character after this.</b>

00:16.310 --> 00:18.140
<b>He had a huge impact.</b>

00:18.240 --> 00:20.770
<b>He became a trading figure too.</b>

00:21.050 --> 00:22.880
<b>That's true.</b>

00:24.220 --> 00:26.550
<b>Although most people
didn't want him.</b>

00:27.350 --> 00:30.690
<b>But his butt and his belly were well made.
They were plump.</b>

00:30.790 --> 00:33.450
<b>Oh, he was made kinda sexy,
wasn't he?</b>

00:46.440 --> 00:50.170
<b>Next is the Party Night episode.</b>

00:50.280 --> 00:54.910
<b>The director had wanted to do
an episode like this for a long time,</b>

00:55.010 --> 00:57.540
<b>and it was finally made.</b>

00:58.520 --> 01:03.720
<b>Because the slot
for the anime was short,</b>

01:04.360 --> 01:08.690
<b>he thought it would be perfect
for one song,</b>

01:08.790 --> 01:11.890
<b>kind of like a music video.</b>

01:13.360 --> 01:16.530
<b>This is a very popular episode in Japan.</b>

01:18.200 --> 01:20.540
<b>It's pretty popular in the U.S. too.</b>

01:21.340 --> 01:23.430
<b>The song is popular too.</b>

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
<b>A lot of fans asked us</b>

01:30.880 --> 01:34.940
<b>what we were going to do
with this episode.</b>

01:35.620 --> 01:39.280
<b>We said, of course we're going
to make it into English.</b>

01:39.390 --> 01:40.720
<b>It's an iMac.</b>

01:40.830 --> 01:42.290
<b>Oh yeah!</b>

01:42.930 --> 01:45.090
<b>It was really popular at the time.</b>

01:55.110 --> 01:58.560
<b>This song is a message
to the otaku, isn't it?</b>

01:58.680 --> 02:02.010
<b>Yes, it's saying,
''Please come to our party.''</b>

02:04.780 --> 02:06.480
<b>It mentions things like,
''reading manga.''</b>

02:06.580 --> 02:08.140
<b>That's true.</b>

02:08.390 --> 02:12.220
<b>Like, ''Get out of the house.''</b>

02:12.490 --> 02:15.720
<b>It's a song to energize the otaku.</b>

02:22.330 --> 02:26.600
<b>This episode really helped.</b>

02:26.700 --> 02:31.270
<b>Well, this song was a popular
Di Gi Charat song too.</b>

02:31.380 --> 02:34.210
<b>But it became the number one song.</b>

02:34.310 --> 02:38.370
<b>By the way,
this monochrome scene</b>

02:39.520 --> 02:41.420
<b>was all drawn by hand.</b>

02:43.220 --> 02:44.690
<b>I think it was with a marker.</b>

02:44.790 --> 02:45.920
<b>Yes it was.</b>

02:46.020 --> 02:48.720
<b>All drawn with a marker.</b>

02:52.830 --> 02:59.740
<b>Usually there are in-between animators
who draw the movement.</b>

02:59.840 --> 03:04.300
<b>But the key animator drew
all of the frames there.</b>

03:05.780 --> 03:09.510
<b>It was a lot of work.
Even though it's only a few seconds.</b>

03:17.320 --> 03:18.910
<b>A nurse?</b>

03:19.020 --> 03:20.320
<b>Woah!</b>

03:28.570 --> 03:33.000
<b>So Broccoli held
concerts and events like this</b>

03:33.100 --> 03:35.600
<b>before this episode aired?</b>

03:35.710 --> 03:39.610
<b>Yes, we had some
Di Gi Charat fan events.</b>
